id: AUTHOR7-2
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: play_input_split
target: crates/pack/src/play_run.rs
find:     prefix.map(|p| Op::Input(submit_input(p, raw.to_string())))
replace:     prefix.map(|_| Op::Input(Input::Text(raw.to_string())))
expect-fail: author7_empty_prefix_text_runs_as_command_like_screen
note: 教材テストの cmd:/text: を画面と同じ関数で分けず、常に自然文として渡す
